+## Host-source admission
+
+`HostSourceId` identifies the configured Loader entry that registered a model input without adding deployment metadata to model-provider values. `promptAssemblySourceInventory()` returns the effective section, context, and tool sources after assembly. `SystemPrompt.admitSources()` accepts a predicate over these candidates; every global and matching scoped predicate must accept a candidate before it enters assembly.
+
+```ts type-equiv
+/** Stable Loader-tree identity for one configured plugin source. */
+type HostSourceId = Branded<'HostSourceId'>
+```
+
+```ts type-equiv
+/** One effective assembly entry and the registration source that supplied it. */
+interface PromptAssemblySourceEntry {
+  /** Effective section, context, or tool name. */
+  readonly name: string
+  /** Owning Loader entry path, or {@link UNKNOWN_HOST_SOURCE_ID}. */
+  readonly source: HostSourceId
+}
+```
+
+```ts type-equiv
+/** Sources of every effective model-visible assembly entry. */
+interface PromptAssemblySourceInventory {
+  /** Effective prompt sections in assembly order. */
+  readonly sections: readonly PromptAssemblySourceEntry[]
+  /** Effective dynamic contexts in assembly order. */
+  readonly contexts: readonly PromptAssemblySourceEntry[]
+  /** Effective tool schemas in assembly order. */
+  readonly tools: readonly PromptAssemblySourceEntry[]
+}
+```
+
+```ts type-equiv
+/** Registry contribution considered for model-source admission. */
+interface ModelSourceCandidate {
+  /** Registry kind whose contribution may enter assembly. */
+  readonly kind: 'section' | 'context' | 'tool'
+  /** Effective contribution name. */
+  readonly name: string
+  /** Source captured by the owning registry entry. */
+  readonly source: HostSourceId
+}
+```
+
+```ts type-equiv
+/**
+ * Decide whether one registry contribution may enter an assembly.
+ * @param context - the caller's per-assembly context.
+ * @param candidate - one effective registry contribution and its source.
+ * @returns whether the contribution may enter the assembly.
+ */
+type ModelSourceAdmissionPredicate = (
+  context: AssembleContext,
+  candidate: ModelSourceCandidate,
+) => boolean
+```
